cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite it as below."
title: "Platform_multiomics: unified local multi-omics platform (genomics, epigenomics, transcriptomics, and machine learning)"
abstract: >-
  A unified, container-orchestrated local platform for multi-species omics
  analysis integrating genomics (SnpEff, VEP, Fst), epigenomics (methylKit
  DMCs, TSS profiles, HOMER motifs, MOFA2), transcriptomics (SRA, FastQC/MultiQC,
  Salmon, DESeq2), and machine learning (nested cross-validation, SHAP, minimal
  AIMs panels), with workflow provenance seals, n8n integration, and an offline
  educational mode. Consolidates and supersedes the legacy Platform_genomes and
  Platform_epigenome repositories.
type: software
